#. module: purchase_tender
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:purchase_tender.action_purchase_tender
msgid ""
"A product shows up here as soon as two or more open requests for\n"
"                quotation ask for it. Compare the offers, then award one vendor."
msgstr ""
"Товар появляется здесь, как только его запрашивают два или более\n"
"                открытых запроса цен. Сравните предложения и выберите поставщика."

#. module: purchase_tender
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:purchase_tender.view_tender_line_list
msgid ""
"Award this product to this vendor? On every other request for quotation the "
"line for this product will be removed; a request that has no other line is "
"cancelled."
msgstr "Отдать этот товар данному поставщику? Во всех остальных запросах цен строка по этому товару будет удалена; запрос без других строк будет отменён."

#. module: purchase_tender
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:purchase_tender.view_tender_line_list
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Отменить"

#. module: purchase_tender
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:purchase_tender.view_tender_line_list
msgid "Choose"
msgstr "Выбрать"

#. module: purchase_tender
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:purchase_tender.field_purchase_order_line__display_name
msgid "Display Name"
msgstr "Отображаемое имя"

#. module: purchase_tender
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:purchase_tender.view_tender_line_list
msgid ""
"Drop this offer from the tender? The line will be removed from its request "
"for quotation; if it has no other line the request is cancelled."
msgstr "Убрать это предложение из тендера? Строка будет удалена из своего запроса цен; если других строк нет, запрос будет отменён."

#. module: purchase_tender
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:purchase_tender.view_tender_line_list
msgid "Expected Arrival"
msgstr "Ожидаемая поставка"

#. module: purchase_tender
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:purchase_tender.field_purchase_order_line__id
msgid "ID"
msgstr "ID"

#. module: purchase_tender
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:purchase_tender.field_purchase_order_line__tender_is_candidate
msgid "In Tender"
msgstr "В тендере"

#. module: purchase_tender
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/purchase_tender/models/purchase_order_line.py:0
msgid "It was the only line, so the request for quotation has been cancelled."
msgstr "Это была единственная строка, поэтому запрос цен отменён."

#. module: purchase_tender
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:purchase_tender.action_purchase_tender
msgid "No product is up for tender yet"
msgstr "Пока ни один товар не вынесен на тендер"

#. module: purchase_tender
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/purchase_tender/models/purchase_order_line.py:0
msgid "Only a Purchase Manager can award or drop a tender offer."
msgstr "Выбрать или отклонить тендерное предложение может только менеджер по закупкам."

#. module: purchase_tender
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:purchase_tender.view_tender_line_search
msgid "Product"
msgstr "Товар"

#. module: purchase_tender
#: model:ir.model,name:purchase_tender.model_purchase_order_line
msgid "Purchase Order Line"
msgstr "Позиция заказа на покупку"

#. module: purchase_tender
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:purchase_tender.view_tender_line_list
msgid "Quantity"
msgstr "Количество"

#. module: purchase_tender
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:purchase_tender.view_tender_line_search
msgid "RFQ"
msgstr "Запрос цен"

#. module: purchase_tender
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:purchase_tender.view_tender_line_search
msgid "RFQ Sent"
msgstr "Запрос отправлен"

#. module: purchase_tender
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:purchase_tender.view_tender_line_list
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:purchase_tender.view_tender_line_search
msgid "Request for Quotation"
msgstr "Запрос цен"

#. module: purchase_tender
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:purchase_tender.view_tender_line_list
msgid "Status"
msgstr "Статус"

#. module: purchase_tender
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:purchase_tender.field_purchase_order_line__tender_is_candidate
msgid ""
"Technical: the line is an open offer for a product that at least two "
"different requests for quotation ask for."
msgstr "Техническое: строка — это открытое предложение по товару, который запрашивают минимум два разных запроса цен."

#. module: purchase_tender
#: model:ir.actions.act_window,name:purchase_tender.action_purchase_tender
#: model:ir.ui.menu,name:purchase_tender.menu_purchase_tender
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:purchase_tender.view_tender_line_list
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:purchase_tender.view_tender_line_search
msgid "Tender"
msgstr "Тендер"

#. module: purchase_tender
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:purchase_tender.field_purchase_order_line__tender_company_currency_id
msgid "Tender Company Currency"
msgstr "Тендер: валюта компании"

#. module: purchase_tender
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:purchase_tender.field_purchase_order_line__tender_price_label
msgid "Tender Unit Price"
msgstr "Тендер: цена за единицу"

#. module: purchase_tender
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/purchase_tender/models/purchase_order_line.py:0
msgid ""
"Tender: %(product)s awarded to %(vendor)s — %(qty)s at %(price)s. %(count)s "
"competing offer(s) cleared."
msgstr "Тендер: %(product)s отдан поставщику %(vendor)s — %(qty)s по цене %(price)s. Конкурирующих предложений очищено: %(count)s."

#. module: purchase_tender
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/purchase_tender/models/purchase_order_line.py:0
msgid ""
"Tender: %(product)s was awarded to %(vendor)s on %(order)s. %(outcome)s"
msgstr "Тендер: %(product)s отдан поставщику %(vendor)s по документу %(order)s. %(outcome)s"

#. module: purchase_tender
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/purchase_tender/models/purchase_order_line.py:0
msgid ""
"Tender: the offer from %(vendor)s for %(product)s was dropped. %(outcome)s"
msgstr "Тендер: предложение поставщика %(vendor)s по товару %(product)s убрано. %(outcome)s"

#. module: purchase_tender
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/purchase_tender/models/purchase_order_line.py:0
msgid "The line has been removed."
msgstr "Строка удалена."

#. module: purchase_tender
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/purchase_tender/models/purchase_order_line.py:0
msgid "This line has been removed."
msgstr "Эта строка удалена."

#. module: purchase_tender
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/purchase_tender/models/purchase_order_line.py:0
msgid "This offer is no longer part of an open tender."
msgstr "Это предложение больше не входит в открытый тендер."

#. module: purchase_tender
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:purchase_tender.view_tender_line_list
msgid "Unit"
msgstr "Ед. изм."

#. module: purchase_tender
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:purchase_tender.view_tender_line_list
msgid "Unit Price"
msgstr "Цена за единицу"

#. module: purchase_tender
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:purchase_tender.view_tender_line_list
msgid "Unit Price (Company)"
msgstr "Цена за единицу (компания)"

#. module: purchase_tender
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:purchase_tender.field_purchase_order_line__tender_price_unit_cc
msgid "Unit Price in Company Currency"
msgstr "Цена за единицу в валюте компании"

#. module: purchase_tender
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:purchase_tender.field_purchase_order_line__tender_price_unit_cc
msgid ""
"Unit price converted with the order's own currency rate, so that offers made"
" in different currencies can be compared."
msgstr "Цена за единицу, пересчитанная по курсу самого запроса, чтобы можно было сравнивать предложения в разных валютах."

#. module: purchase_tender
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:purchase_tender.field_purchase_order_line__tender_price_label
msgid ""
"Unit price in the order currency, followed by its company currency value "
"when the two differ."
msgstr "Цена за единицу в валюте запроса; если валюты различаются, в скобках показывается значение в валюте компании."

#. module: purchase_tender
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/purchase_tender/models/purchase_order_line.py:0
msgid "Unsupported operator"
msgstr "Неподдерживаемый оператор"

#. module: purchase_tender
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:purchase_tender.view_tender_line_list
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:purchase_tender.view_tender_line_search
msgid "Vendor"
msgstr "Поставщик"
